{{Infobox deity
| type = Japanese
| name = Matarajin
| image = Ushimatsuri.jpg
| caption = A depiction of the "ox festival" of Matarajin celebrated in [[Kōryū-ji]] in [[Kyoto]].
| deity_of = God of obstacles, pestilence, performing arts and destiny
